Description: High-quality text-to-speech for KDE Plasma
 Vocal Plasma is a high-quality text-to-speech system using the Kokoro ONNX
 neural network model. It provides natural-sounding speech synthesis with
 multiple voice options including American and British accents.
 .
 Features:
  - High-quality neural TTS with 82M parameter model
  - Multiple voices (American/British, Male/Female)
  - Simple command-line interface
  - KDE Plasma keyboard shortcut integration
  - Supports piped input for easy text processing
 .
 The package includes the Kokoro v1.0 ONNX model (310MB) and voice
 embeddings (27MB) for offline speech synthesis.